[Unit]
Description=RideAuto Telegram channel: 2 Korea + 2 China/day (10/13/16/19 Asia/Yekaterinburg)

[Timer]
# Host TZ is Europe/Moscow. Force UTC: 05/08/11/14 UTC = 10/13/16/19 YEKT.
